# CatDex Design System

**Source of truth:** `src/theme/` via `useTheme()` from `@/theme`. Never hardcode hex/rgba or ad-hoc spacing. Do not use tokens from `ChatDex Mobile App UI/` (Figma/web export).

```ts
import { useTheme } from '@/theme';
const { colors, spacing, radius, typography, shadow, gradients, motion, iconSize } = useTheme();
```

## Colors (white-first · navy brand · turquoise accent)

| Token | Value | Role |
|---|---|---|
| `brand` / `textBrand` | `#11145A` | Headings, active nav |
| `brandPressed` | `#0C0F42` | Pressed navy |
| `brandSoft` | `rgba(17,20,90,0.08)` | Soft navy tint |
| `accent` / `primary` | `#2EC9C3` | Primary buttons, FAB, progress |
| `accentPressed` | `#24A8A3` | Pressed turquoise |
| `accentSoft` | `rgba(46,201,195,0.14)` | Soft turquoise tint |
| `ctaSecondary` | `#F5F5F5` | Secondary CTA fill |
| `ctaSecondaryBorder` | `#D0D0D0` | Secondary CTA border |
| `ctaSecondaryLabel` | `#8F8F8F` | Secondary CTA label |
| `background` / `surface` | `#FFFFFF` | App canvas |
| `surfaceSecondary` | `#F7F8FC` | Inputs, muted cards |
| `surfaceTertiary` / `surfaceMuted` | `#F2F4F8` | Nested surfaces |
| `text` | `#15172B` | Primary ink |
| `textBody` | `rgba(21,23,43,0.78)` | Body copy |
| `textSecondary` | `#667085` | Supporting text |
| `textMuted` / `placeholder` | `#98A2B3` | Metadata, placeholders |
| `border` | `#E8EAF0` | Subtle borders |
| `borderDefault` | `#D9DDE6` | Default control borders |
| `focusRing` | `#2EC9C3` | Focus |
| `success` / `warning` / `danger` / `info` | semantic | States (+ Soft variants) |
| `tabBar` | `rgba(255,255,255,0.96)` | Bottom nav |
| `onAccent` / `onPrimary` | `#FFFFFF` | On turquoise |
| `onBrand` | `#FFFFFF` | On navy |

Coat / rarity accents: `src/lib/catTheme.ts` only — never as app chrome.

**Gradients:** `primary` turquoise, `xp` turquoise→green. Avoid heavy multi-stop gradients.

## Typography

Fonts: iOS System (SF); Android/web Syne (display) + Manrope (body).

Use `<Text variant="…" color="…" />` — prefer `color="textBrand"` for titles.

| Variant | Size / Line / Tracking |
|---|---|
| `display` | 40 / 48 / -1.2 |
| `h1` | 32 / 40 / -0.8 |
| `h2` | 24 / 32 / -0.4 |
| `h3` | 20 / 28 / -0.2 |
| `body` | 16 / 24 / -0.1 |
| `bodySmall` | 14 / 20 / 0 |
| `caption` | 12 / 16 / 0.1 |
| `label` | 12 / 16 / 0.8 uppercase |

## Spacing — 8pt grid

Allowed: `4 · 8 · 16 · 24 · 32 · 40 · 48 · 56 · 64 · 80 · 96`  
Screen padding `24` · card padding `16`/`24` · section gap `32` · button height `56`.

## Radius

Surfaces / inputs / cards: `8` (`radius.xs` / `sm` / `md` / `lg` / `sheet` → 8).  
Auth & primary CTAs: `16` (`radius.cta` / `radius[16]` / `xl`).  
Circles only: `pill` / `full` (FAB, avatar, badge, progress).

## Elevation

Prefer borders + soft navy-tinted shadows: `shadow.none | low | medium | floating | glow`.  
Cards: border + `low`. FAB/nav: `medium`. Sheets: `floating`. Glow = turquoise FAB only.

## Motion / Icons

`fast≈140 · standard/normal≈220 · slow≈320 · reveal≈520`. Press `0.98` / card `0.99`.  
Icons: inline `react-native-svg`; sizes `sm=16 md=24 lg=32 xl=40`.

## Components

- Prefer shared: `Text`, `Button` (`primary|secondary|ghost|destructive|icon`), `TextInput`/`SearchInput`, `Card`/`PhotoCard`, `Chip`, `Badge`, `BottomSheet`, `EmptyState`, `Spinner`/`Skeleton`.
- Brand: **CatDex** — “Ton quartier. Tes chats.”

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<View style={{ backgroundColor: '#1a1a2e', padding: 13, shadowOpacity: 0.5 }} />

// ✅ GOOD
const { colors, spacing, radius, shadow } = useTheme();
<View style={[{ backgroundColor: colors.surface, padding: spacing.md, borderRadius: radius.lg, borderWidth: 1, borderColor: colors.border }, shadow.low]} />
<Text variant="h3" color="textBrand">Title</Text>
```
